    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend your home planet from ever increasing hordes of creatures in this Atari styled roguelite!</h2><br>This game is an adaptation of a never seen before Atari game that I'm in possesion of, although Its contents are heavily damaged, I'm hoping that this game gives off what the original devs at Hermit-Host were intending! <br><br><strong>This Game Features:</strong><br>* A Full Fledged Story Mode<br>* An Endless Mode<br>* An Intuitive Tutorial<br>* 3 Playable Characters<br>* A Logbook With Unlockable Entries<br>* An Original Soundtrack!<br>* And More!!!!<br><br>and with that being said,<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Zragg on.</h2>",
